  <section class="section-space light-section" id="sobre-el-curso"><div class="wrap split-section"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> 01 / SOBRE EL CURSO</div><h2>Lorem ipsum<br /><em>dolor sit amet.</em></h2></div><div><p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed vitae ligula at eros varius efficitur. Aenean euismod, urna id aliquet vulputate, nisi nibh convallis velit.</p><p>Curabitur ullamcorper, nisl vel tempor interdum, nibh turpis laoreet augue, vel luctus purus magna at lorem. Donec volutpat feugiat mi.</p></div></div></section>
